{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026et1HNDhfwf1795695197.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中央宣傳部前副部長、廣電總局前局長蔡赴朝，涉嫌嚴重違紀違法，被開除黨籍。</p><p></p><p><strong>蔡赴朝7月接受調查</strong></p><p></p><p>蔡赴朝7月接受調查，被指違規收受禮品、禮金、違規接受宴請及旅遊活動安排等。又形容他貪慾膨脹，以權謀私。利用職務便利為他人在影視作品審批及銷售，廣告經營權獲取等牟利，並非法收受巨額財物。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.OFFICIAL-2000_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Ad15MAlwNg1795696025.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><strong>通報形容性質嚴重影響惡劣</strong></p><p></p><p>通報形容是性質嚴重，影響惡劣，根據有關規定開除他的黨籍，並將他涉嫌犯罪問題，移送檢察機關依法審查起訴。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T13:04:07.493962+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":204,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T11:21:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T16:17:34.761723+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T12:57:16.867478+00:00","content_hash":"469d882b086f1e91ef1c0c7604a44cd718aefa7d18f32c42862705af7846c0e4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T13:04:07.493962+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}